# MD5s of the ten QfO 2020_04 proteomes that existing caches were built from.
#
# Nine targets plus the human query. Every kmerseek index
# (<label>.<alphabet>.k<k>.lc<lc>.kmerseek.rocksdb), every stored search
# (human_vs_<label>...regions.parquet) and every foldseek/mmseqs/reseek/prostt5
# target database names its species by LABEL only -- no release, no checksum. A
# different release dropped into place under the same names is not a cache miss,
# it is a silently wrong cache hit.
#
